  "recipeDetail": "Comments from the Creator\nIdeal for nighttime settings and indoor lighting, this design features a high-saturation colour scheme with melancholic blue lighting and a strong contrast of soft, warm tones. This combination effectively produces film-like color tones reminiscent of Hong Kong, evoking a nostalgic cyberpunk city atmosphere. It evokes emotions and immerses viewers in a dreamlike urban landscape, connecting them to shared memories and experiences of city life.",
